Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1023-1024] Onigashima 34 - So-and-So.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.59,0:01:37.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn them, attacking our All-Stars...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:51.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I would not do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.15,0:01:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!\NKawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.86,0:01:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes!\NKawamatsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.57,0:01:56.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's beat them to a pulp!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.49,0:01:58.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:02:00.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:03.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...giving them a hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:05.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...in their duels!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.00,0:02:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But Kingpin Hyogoro,\Nthey're up against the All-Stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whether friend or foe, you will keep\Nanyone and everyone from their fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:17.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.05,0:02:21.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Don't get in our way"\Nis written all over their faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.19,0:02:37.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All that's at the top\Nof the Red Line...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.61,0:02:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is Mary Geoise, yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.08,0:02:49.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you're not the kinda guy\Nto ask the gods for help, yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.79,0:02:52.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're drunk\Noff your ass, huh, Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.13,0:02:53.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bet l am!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.92,0:03:01.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And those oh-so-great Celestial Dragons\Nlive up there in Mary Geoise, yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.76,0:03:06.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No "gods" there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:11.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'm talking about\Nway, way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:15.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Long before Mary Geoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.57,0:03:21.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heard there was this\N"Land of the Gods" up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Land of the Gods"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:27.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saying stuff like that\Nain't like you, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.33,0:03:34.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Along, long time ago,\Nupon the red wall
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:52.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Marco!\NNo sleeping on the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.81,0:03:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is war!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was just waiting\Nfor you to help out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.98,0:04:01.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Foolishness!\NWe are leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.28,0:04:06.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Believe in any gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:08.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You sound like Pops\Nwhen he was drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.49,0:04:10.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo, bros!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.87,0:04:11.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo, bros!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:14.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a sec\Nthat you're gonna beat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.33,0:04:19.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your attacks did squat to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:25.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Listen up, and listen good!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:29.76,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1248,677)}The Drought
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.27,0:04:33.77,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,90)}The Wildfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.27,0:04:38.27,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(963,94)}And, the Plague!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:42.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are Kaido-san's protectors:\NThe Three Calamities!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.53,0:04:46.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They call us the All-Stars\Nbecause we're unbeatable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.71,0:05:02.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:08.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, after I put on my Raid Suit\Nfor the third time, my body's felt off...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.09,0:05:10.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just don't trip me up, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:13.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Didn't say anything about\Nbeing under the weather...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:14.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just feelin' weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:16.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's your eyebrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.23,0:05:18.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you, it's my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.15,0:05:27.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First one you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.11,0:05:30.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bridal Grabber!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:34.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Back down to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:39.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Germa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.88,0:05:43.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Germa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:50.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard all you kids of his're cyborgs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vinsmoke Judge...\NTotally nuts, the madman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:58.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That flaming leg\Nof yours a machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:03.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Too bad for you!\NI'm a hundred percent human, unlike them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.57,0:06:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Humans can't just\Nturn flames on like that, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unless you're a Lunarian, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.62,0:06:12.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, but we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:15.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn up the heat, that is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:19.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My passion burns\Nhotter than any fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:24.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can even cook up some\NSea Monster dishes with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:26.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you dumb dino!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:34.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna show you\Nwhat cyborgs're really made of...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.18,0:06:36.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somethin' even\NVegapunk can't recreate!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eyes on me, black mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.24,0:06:57.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hell kinda blade is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:07.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I get it now...\NYou're a killing machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.26,0:07:17.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does one need\Nstyles and forms in a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:21.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right.\NYou never called yourself a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:28.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who knows, by the end of this\NI might be tearing your throat out with my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.82,0:07:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whatever it takes to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:37.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kingpin Hyogoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.70,0:07:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When Hiyori-sama said\Nshe would bequeath Enma upon him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:46.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,there was a reason\NI could not stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.17,0:07:56.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If indeed your blade is Shusui,\NI ask that you would render it unto the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:58.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you! That's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:02.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You shall have a replacement!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:07.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A sword bequeathed to me\Nby my departed father...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It shall be yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:19.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're trading one-for-one...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know why you couldn't.\NHe's a pirate from abroad, yet it's strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:37.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He is the spitting image of\Nthe Daimyo of Ringo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.27,0:08:49.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shimotsuki Ushimaru,\Nin his prime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.07,0:08:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quite right!\NRight down to his swordplay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.74,0:09:02.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ushimaru-sama was a descendant\Nof the God of the Blade, Shimotsuki Ryuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:03.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and a great swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:10.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even the fact that he returned Shusui\Nto the Land of Wano feels like 'twas fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:26.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That, and Ryuma being a\None-eyed samurai himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:35.57,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(740,242)}Treasury
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:07.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hit a wall, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:11.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And you can't even take your Sulong form,\Nwith no way for moonlight to reach you in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.77,0:10:15.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bedtime for you, Day King!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.57,0:10:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll let off...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:26.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that pile of rubble you call a country,\Nfor keeping up the lie...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.45,0:10:29.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that there was no samurai there!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:40.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring Raizo to me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.76,0:10:42.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or this time I'm loppin' it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.76,0:10:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear to God that I don't know\Nanyone named Raizo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:48.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If there's anyone by that name here,\NI'll slice my stomach open!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.94,0:10:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.73,0:10:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.57,0:11:04.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Had we sold out Raizo then...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.74,0:11:07.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...our shame would\Nhave been so unbearable...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:14.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...that we would not have\Ndared return here, to Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.09,0:11:15.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those your last words?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:19.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme help you end it all...\Nby removing your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ever since the day Oden-sama died...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:29.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...we spent every\Nwaking moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...preparing for this,\Nour final battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:53.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For two decades,\Nwe asked ourselves:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:55.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Are you still Oden-sama's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.63,0:11:58.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"...samurai?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.80,0:12:00.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You damned dirty dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.17,0:12:02.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That form!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:06.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How are you in Sulong form?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:11.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A hole in the ceiling?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:19.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will not...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.23,0:12:23.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...stain the name of\NKozuki Oden any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:44.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if our\Nmillennium-old city crumbled...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:52.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...we had to forge our way here,\Nto our ultimate battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:59.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter who among us dies,\Nwe shall win this battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:11.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the Dawn shall come\Nfor the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:23.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The enemy just keeps\Nflooding out of the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:41.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is where our fates\Nshall be decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:44.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Piss off!\NThis is our castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:47.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get outta our way,\Ndamned samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.78,0:13:52.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave, and nobody gets hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.00,0:14:02.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrot, Wanda!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:04.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master Nekomamushi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.55,0:14:08.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Preciate you gara all\Nsavin' some for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.97,0:14:11.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:17.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it weren't fer Pedro,\NLuffy 'n the others wouldn't be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:20.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This raid would be\None big flop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pedro, huh?\NLooking to get revenge for that jaguar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:29.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What an awfully beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...full moon tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pedro!\NWatch over us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:42.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hope yer enjoyin'\Na drink or two, meow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.59,0:14:51.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But fer you, Lick-Spittle...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:57.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's the last moon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.31,0:15:01.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ye'll ever see!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:03.40,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1436,323)}Castle interior\N3rd floor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.82,0:15:13.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now that Oden is dead,\Nwatching you idiot ghosts serve his brat is comical!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!\NYouth is nothing to laugh at!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.37,0:15:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just as people like us\Ngrew up to become Samurai,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,others do the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:27.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano shall watch over Momonosuke-sama\Nas he transforms into a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:30.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And that is why we will not allow your ilk\Nto steal away our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:32.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clone Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.97,0:15:40.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To my ninja techniques,\NI commit all my strength...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.35,0:15:43.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...so that I may lay waste\Nto enemies of the Kozuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.44,0:15:46.94,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1485,405)}Tokage Port\NUdon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.82,0:15:48.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.49,0:15:59.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wo... W-W-What's\Ngoin' on here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:04.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-A-A dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.54,0:16:07.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is Kaido here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.09,0:16:09.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can we even manage to fight him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.55,0:16:11.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me to join in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:21.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am no morsel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:24.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you dare attempt to eat me,\NI shall devour you first!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:26.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Restrain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:33.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous over there, Straw Hat!\NStay away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:46.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That you, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.08,0:16:48.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.71,0:16:51.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's...\Nthe runt we saw earlier?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.17,0:16:52.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.59,0:16:54.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nuuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.09,0:16:57.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Tis the work of my\NRipe-Ripe Technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:17:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At Momonosuke-sama's request,\Nhe is now twenty-eight years of age!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.23,0:17:05.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.44,0:17:08.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why the tears, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.52,0:17:11.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.74,0:17:19.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!\NYou are the spitting image of...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:34.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Momo...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.63,0:17:37.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna take back Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:40.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.36,0:17:57.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They all keeled over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.87,0:18:05.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's with you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.54,0:18:06.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get a grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Did you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.79,0:18:12.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...use Conqueror's Haki, croc?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.42,0:18:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Caught me red-handed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.17,0:18:19.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,knew it, croc!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.35,0:18:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You just don't have the willpower to\Nstay conscious in my overwhelming presence!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.81,0:18:29.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm the guy that took out\Ntwo of the Flying Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usohachi the Sibling Hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:34.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Flying Six!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.78,0:18:36.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two of them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:44.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can't beat me? Join me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.29,0:18:57.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I dun get what's goin' on,\Nbut it's pretty amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:19:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's because Big Mom is fighting\Non the same floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:05.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rank-and-file here fell like dominoes\Nin the wake of her Conqueror's Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:08.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.77,0:19:11.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Any idea what happened to Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.73,0:19:13.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a damn clue...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:16.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what Momo said earlier\Nis all that matters, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:18.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy yet lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.99,0:19:23.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He speaks to me now!\NSaying that he shall return!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.78,0:19:29.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu-chan's supposed to be with him,\Nbut I can't reach her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.83,0:19:33.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No news is good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:36.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on, what's that\Nsupposed to mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.21,0:19:38.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on down when you're done\Ndoing what you gotta!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.76,0:19:45.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For some reason, the bad guys're\Nhitting the Performance Floor non-stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.43,0:19:47.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We could use a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:49.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? The Performance Floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.10,0:19:50.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Clik.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:51.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo, jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.94,0:19:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let 'em through!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:59.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro and Sanji're fighting the All-Stars\Non the Performance Floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.45,0:20:04.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do!\NAye aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.24,0:20:06.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're all equals in an alliance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:10.20,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1566,359)}Castle interior\N3rd floor
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.29,0:20:14.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Hooothothot!\NI think I feel hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.67,0:20:21.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though I'm already cremated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.72,0:20:27.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Robin-san is going to burn up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:29.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baron Corpse!\NAre you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:33.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can no longer\Nstay in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.39,0:20:35.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Would any of you know\Nhow the war is faring?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it's just chaos everywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:42.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I did see the First Son of the Sea,\NJinbe, on the fourth floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.24,0:20:47.24,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1486,312)}Castle interior\N4th floor
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.59,0:21:04.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arabesque Brick Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.18,0:21:18.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I reckon your captain is\Nstill fighting Kaido, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.27,0:21:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't know...\NI was wondering that myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.73,0:21:25.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That so...\NThe whole situation is a right mess
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.53,0:21:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we need to ferret out\Nwhere the key players are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:32.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring...\NRing, ring, ring... Clik.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:35.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Jinbe-san! Jinbe-san!\NWe have a problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.16,0:21:38.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The third floor will\Nsoon be engulfed in fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.38,0:21:40.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must descend while you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:44.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fire!\NThat's definitely not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:46.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But who, exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:49.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is holding Kaido at bay\Nup there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:56.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Narikabura Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:03.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vajra Arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.87,0:22:17.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.33,0:22:20.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...can't be Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.09,0:22:24.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have always...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.21,0:22:25.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...been trying to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.09,0:22:28.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:30.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This ain't some\Nfather-son quarrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.59,0:22:35.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you really wanna call yourself "Oden,"\Nyou better be ready for war!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.27,0:22:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't play games,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.23,0:22:38.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.36,0:22:44.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is admiring someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.40,0:22:46.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...a sin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.03,0:22:56.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I love Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:06.38,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1569,393)}20 years in the past
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.88,0:23:06.38,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(297,433)}Onigashima
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.51,0:23:08.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Away with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:12.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will defend the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open Wano's borders!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:18.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just brutal, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.81,0:23:21.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's been like that\Nfor a week now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.77,0:23:23.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't back down now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.65,0:23:28.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's got Kaido-san's blood in her veins,\Nbut she's still just a little kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.24,0:23:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brute force her into stopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.24,0:23:32.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Brave words!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:35.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then stop me,\Nif you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:48.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting already!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.96,0:23:50.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.92,0:23:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.30,0:23:53.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.59,0:23:55.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.30,0:23:57.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...en!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.60,0:24:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.58,0:24:25.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This your doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.71,0:24:27.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.92,0:24:30.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wrong!\NI am Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.67,0:24:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.76,0:24:37.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...am Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.43,0:24:41.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Yamato!\NDid you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.73,0:24:45.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do not know...\NThey all fell on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NUnchain me, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.86,0:24:53.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am starving to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.74,0:24:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see...\NIt's the Color of the Conqueror.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.03,0:24:58.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You show promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.41,0:25:02.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if you're gonna keep\Ncalling yourself Oden,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.16,0:25:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.08,0:25:04.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.41,0:25:05.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:07.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.63,0:25:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a month...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.55,0:25:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout you\Ncool your head while you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.76,0:25:25.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait! How can you just leave me\Nin a dark place like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.10,0:25:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-A month, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.81,0:25:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Ogre Princess may be tough,\Nbut even she would die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.36,0:25:37.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Besides, there are vicious\NWano samurai behind that door...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.16,0:25:41.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like that idiot over there...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.08,0:25:44.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.83,0:25:49.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If any of you change your minds,\Nshout through the air hole in the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.50,0:25:51.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you decide you wanna be\None of my soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.88,0:25:54.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll let you out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.21,0:25:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many days have the\Nbunch of you been without food!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.68,0:26:00.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NBring 'em some food!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.64,0:26:01.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.97,0:26:03.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...just for one person.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.69,0:26:10.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samurai gotta have\Ntheir swords, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.57,0:26:12.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.53,0:26:18.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am the child of Kaido!\NI know they bear me ill will!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.95,0:26:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you leave swords for them,\Nthey will kill me right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.95,0:26:25.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.62,0:26:27.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're Oden, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.14,0:26:42.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I may be Oden, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.64,0:26:45.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...l am also the son of Kaido,\NOden's murderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.56,0:26:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know the Samurai\Nwill absolutely loathe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.82,0:26:56.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father wants us\Nto fight each other to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.65,0:26:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And over a meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.71,0:27:10.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.00,0:27:13.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They will kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.18,0:27:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.35,0:27:26.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh?\NWha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.97,0:27:28.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No need to be so reserved!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.77,0:27:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samurai do not feel hunger, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.48,0:27:35.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.32,0:27:40.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am very...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.53,0:27:42.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.91,0:27:47.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If none of you Samurai will eat,\Nthen may I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.74,0:27:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure, go on.\NHell of a family you were born into...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.50,0:27:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.01,0:28:03.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samurai are amazing!\NHard to believe you do not feel hunger!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.21,0:28:35.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fank you aww...\NSammmurai...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.54,0:28:40.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K'll nebbr fuhget...\Nduh tashte ub dis meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.59,0:28:43.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.84,0:28:47.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Can I become a samurai\Neven though I feel hunger?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.89,0:28:56.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hands in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.06,0:28:57.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yo... Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.16,0:29:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay calm, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.99,0:29:12.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're Kozuki Oden, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.00,0:29:14.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We heard you, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.37,0:29:17.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We, too, love that man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.96,0:29:20.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!\NAre you people his friends?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.46,0:29:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is your name, Samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.01,0:29:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Asking a defeated samurai his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.89,0:29:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just call me So-and-So.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.10,0:29:35.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want to read this journal...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.35,0:29:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"but there are a lot of\Ndifficult characters...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.02,0:29:41.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden's logbook?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.82,0:29:48.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"The world is made up of four seas\Nand one long strip of sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.53,0:29:52.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Furthermore, the world is round,\Nmuch like a shiratama dango.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.58,0:29:54.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"It is truly perplexing!"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.25,0:30:01.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah... How long has it been!\NAbout ten days?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.34,0:30:05.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have no idea...\NIn here, nothing changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.51,0:30:10.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato... Is your father really going to\Nlet his child die?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.35,0:30:16.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At this rate, we may not be able to see the battle\Nthat Oden said would take place in twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.52,0:30:21.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When that happens,\NI will fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.86,0:30:24.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...alongside the Land of Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.28,0:30:27.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And will set out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.82,0:30:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...to become stronger\Nand stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.24,0:30:35.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's reassuring
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.20,0:30:36.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.79,0:30:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...by not allowing you to die here,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.96,0:30:43.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we shall be taking part\Nin the future war.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.84,0:30:45.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hwuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.47,0:30:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Twenty years is...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.68,0:30:54.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...a little too long for us to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.64,0:31:00.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samurai!\NIf you do that, my father will...!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.06,0:31:04.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We would rather not\Nrot away like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.48,0:31:07.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We had no intention of\Ngiving in to Kaido...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.86,0:31:09.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...from the very beginning!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.12,0:31:20.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We leave the\NLand of Wano in your hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.71,0:31:31.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido-sama!\NThey've shattered the Sacred Stone Door!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.51,0:31:33.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let them leave here alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.85,0:31:39.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are people who believe in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.85,0:31:41.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who accept me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.94,0:31:48.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to\Ntake away my freedom?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.07,0:31:50.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the freedom of\Nthe Land of Wano?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.19,0:31:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Life isn't a series of\Nsimple questions and answers!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.78,0:31:55.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You damned whelp!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.33,0:32:04.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder Bagua!
